# AbroBot CRM — routing for crm.mnbresearch.com (Cloudflare Pages).
#
# This file is copied into site/, the publish directory, by
# scripts/build-site.sh. Only the allowlisted files in site/ are served; the
# rest of the repository (docs, SQL, scripts, app source, old bundles) is not.
#
# Order matters: Cloudflare Pages applies the FIRST matching rule. Real files
# in site/ (product.html, pricing.html, widget.js, ...) are served before any
# rule here, so they need no entry.
#
# ── The legacy app is retired (14 October 2026) ─────────────────────────────
# /get, /onboarding, /myday, /priority, /compose, /analytics, /leaderboard and
# /super used to be rewritten to legacy.html — the original bundle, which still
# ran its own signup, pricing and password flows on this domain. legacy.html and
# its bundles stay in the repository as history but are no longer published,
# so those paths now fall through to the current app below.
#
# /get was the target of every "Sign up free" / "Get started" link on the
# marketing pages and in llms.txt. Those now point at /login (the same place
# the landing page's "Start free" goes); this keeps old links and bookmarks
# working. 301 because the move is permanent.
/get            /login          301

# Browsers request /favicon.ico when a page declares no icon. Without this the
# catch-all answered with the app shell (HTML, HTTP 200).
/favicon.ico    /favicon.svg    301

# ── Everything else: the app ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client-side routes (/login, /leads, /leads/:id, /settings, ...) need this so a
# hard refresh does not 404.
/*              /index.html     200
